%% INFO 请求处理时序（源码：network/connection/CommandHandler → command/* → observability/ServerInfoProvider）
sequenceDiagram
    participant CH as CommandHandler
    participant CE as CommandEngine
    participant CR as CommandRegistry
    participant IC as InfoCommand
    participant SIP as ServerInfoProvider
    participant TC as TieringController
    participant SM as StorageMetrics
    participant MR as MetricsRegistry

    CH->>CE: execute(RespCommand)
    CE->>CR: find("info")
    CR-->>CE: InfoCommand
    CE->>IC: execute(args, storage)

    Note over IC,SIP: 全量 INFO 走 render()；INFO sstables 走 sections()
    IC->>SIP: render()
    SIP->>TC: refreshGaugesThrottled()（200ms 窗口）
    TC->>SM: setMemoryGauges / setColdGauges / in-progress
    SIP->>SM: snapshot()（本次渲染唯一快照）
    SM-->>SIP: Snapshot(memory, cold, flush, compaction, cache)
    SIP->>MR: snapshot()（QPS/延迟分位）
    MR-->>SIP: Snapshot(p50/p95/p99/max)
    SIP-->>IC: INFO 文本（Server / Memory / Tiering 段落）
    IC-->>CE: RespBulkString
    CE-->>CH: RespValue
    CH->>CH: ResponseSequencer 保序
    CH-->>CH: ctx.writeAndFlush()

    Note over SM: gauge 来自 O(1) 计数器与表元数据；<br/>counter 为自启动累计，重启归零